2. NOTICE OF MODIFICATIONS & DATES (GNU GPLv3 Section 5(a))
------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (C) 2026 @ItsLytso
Modifications and new original modules contributed by @ItsLytso are
likewise licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later.

Summary of notable modifications in 2026:
  - 2026-11-20: Rebranded application identity to LytsoCoder under
    independent Android package IDs (`lytso.code` release,
    `lytso.cdev` debug) and isolated loopback ports
    (1240/1241/8770 release; 1242/1243/8771 debug) for conflict-free
    side-by-side execution.
  - 2026-11-20: Removed TelemetryDeck SDK and analytics/telemetry
    reporting calls; updated release/updater workflows.
  - 2026-11-20: Added independent, reproducible rootfs and offline
    STEM render-bundle builders (`scripts/build_rootfs.py`,
    `scripts/render_bundle/build_render_bundle.sh`, and
    `.github/workflows/rootfs.yml`).
  - 2026-11-20: Implemented Enhanced Conversation & Context Control:
    editable Global Context and per-chat system prompts, non-destructive
    in-place message editing (`agy_ide_bridge/pkg/brainctl` for SQLite
    protobuf conversations and Claude JSONL transcripts), thinking-step
    deletion, obsolete artifact deletion with context payload
    redaction, direct context sync, and message-level fork/branching.
  - 2026-11-20: Added Android 11+ seccomp-BPF process management
    safety (`agy_ide_bridge/pkg/procutil` using direct `syscall.Kill`
    instead of `pidfd_send_signal`), zero-disconnect hub pause/restart
    handling, and automatic CSRF token rotation.
  - 2026-11-20: Added this NOTICE document, updated README legal
    disclosures, and created an original LytsoCoder vector emblem
    (`docs/readme/lytsocoder-icon.svg`).

